WEBVTT

00:05.171 --> 00:10.552
This is the fifth case this year
of a girl being found strangled to death.

00:11.052 --> 00:12.762
According to investigators,

00:12.846 --> 00:15.932
they view these repeated cases as linked

00:16.016 --> 00:17.934
and are investigating accordingly.

00:21.730 --> 00:23.648
What? You're going to be a dad?

00:23.732 --> 00:24.733
Yes.

00:24.816 --> 00:25.984
Congratulations!

00:26.067 --> 00:27.068
Congratulations!

00:27.152 --> 00:27.986
Thank you.

00:28.069 --> 00:30.613
I had no idea.
You should have told us!

00:30.697 --> 00:31.531
Sorry.

00:31.614 --> 00:34.159
Dr. Takamori,
I bet you'll be a great father.

00:34.868 --> 00:35.910
I wonder.

00:35.994 --> 00:37.037
We have to celebrate.

00:37.120 --> 00:38.371
No, you don't have to.

00:38.455 --> 00:40.206
A pre-celebration drink.
A big one!

00:40.290 --> 00:42.709
-You just want to drink.
-No, I don't!

00:42.792 --> 00:44.586
Dr. Masumi is on vacation, right?

00:44.669 --> 00:45.712
Now is our chance.

00:47.088 --> 00:48.965
Hello, this is Medical Examiner Japan.

00:49.048 --> 00:51.718
How does the mindset
of becoming a father feel?

00:51.801 --> 00:53.052
I'm not sure.

00:53.136 --> 00:54.471
It hasn't really sunk in yet.

00:54.554 --> 00:55.889
When is the due date?

00:55.972 --> 00:57.515
For now, it's next weekend.

00:57.599 --> 00:58.558
Really?

00:58.641 --> 01:00.143
Hey, excuse me.

01:00.226 --> 01:02.771
We got a request
for an examination of a living person.

01:03.772 --> 01:07.650
A child suspected of being abused
was in an accident.

01:10.612 --> 01:12.739
Clinical forensic medicine, right?

01:12.822 --> 01:14.032
Yes.

01:14.115 --> 01:16.201
It's rare, isn't it?

01:16.284 --> 01:19.287
Until now, we've only done
examinations on bodies.

01:19.370 --> 01:21.247
With domestic violence, abuse,

01:21.331 --> 01:24.918
or other special cases, we sometimes
get asked to do an examination.

01:25.001 --> 01:26.628
What should we do?

01:26.711 --> 01:27.796
Unfortunately,

01:27.879 --> 01:29.714
I can't come back yet.

01:30.590 --> 01:33.510
Could you all handle it by yourself?

01:33.593 --> 01:36.596
What? Without you?

01:37.096 --> 01:40.517
Clinical forensic medicine
is Dr. Takamori's specialty.

01:41.100 --> 01:42.435
I'll let him handle it.

01:46.856 --> 01:48.066
I understand.

01:48.149 --> 01:50.568
All right, then. Thank you.

01:53.988 --> 01:55.156
That's unusual.

01:55.240 --> 01:57.158
Dr. Masumi never dumps a job
on someone else.

01:57.242 --> 01:58.701
That's true.

01:59.285 --> 02:00.829
I wonder where he's going.

02:06.126 --> 02:07.794
Sorry we're late.

02:07.877 --> 02:10.171
Huh? That doctor isn't here today?

02:10.255 --> 02:12.590
He couldn't quite make it today.

02:12.674 --> 02:14.259
Well, that helps.

02:19.222 --> 02:20.431
Explain it to them.

02:20.515 --> 02:21.349
Yes, ma'am.

02:21.432 --> 02:24.144
The victim is ten-year-old Kanata Togawa.

02:24.227 --> 02:28.481
A neighbor found him collapsed here,
and he was rushed to the hospital.

02:28.565 --> 02:32.193
He still hasn't regained consciousness
and is receiving treatment.

02:32.694 --> 02:35.572
We don't know yet
if it was an accident or a crime.

02:38.241 --> 02:42.328
What kind of findings suggest abuse?

02:42.412 --> 02:45.623
Bruises all over his body.
On his back, his arms, everywhere.

02:45.707 --> 02:48.459
But there were no reports
to the child consultation center.

02:48.543 --> 02:51.462
Also, I don't think it's relevant,

02:51.546 --> 02:53.339
but just to let you know…

02:53.423 --> 02:54.257
You're okay.

02:54.340 --> 02:55.258
The monster…

02:56.217 --> 02:58.177
The monster is coming.

02:58.970 --> 03:01.806
The black monster…

03:01.890 --> 03:04.642
He said that and then lost consciousness.

03:04.726 --> 03:05.727
Monster?

03:06.978 --> 03:08.396
We found a knife!

03:14.068 --> 03:17.363
Maybe he was attacked with this
by the person who was abusing him,

03:17.447 --> 03:18.740
and then fell from here?

03:18.823 --> 03:21.326
First, we need to find out
if there really was abuse.

03:21.409 --> 03:22.243
Yes, ma'am.

03:23.620 --> 03:25.371
Just imagining it

03:26.331 --> 03:27.582
is painful.

03:39.886 --> 03:40.803
Come in.

03:41.721 --> 03:42.931
Excuse me.

03:43.014 --> 03:44.641
I'm Kiryu from MEJ.

03:44.724 --> 03:45.892
I'm Takamori.

03:45.975 --> 03:50.313
We received a request for an examination
because there's a suspicion of abuse.

03:50.396 --> 03:53.733
He hit his head quite hard,
so please be careful.

03:53.816 --> 03:54.817
Yes, sir.

03:59.906 --> 04:01.032
Kanata…

04:02.992 --> 04:04.118
I'm sorry.

04:06.371 --> 04:07.372
Please.

04:07.455 --> 04:08.289
Okay.

04:37.986 --> 04:39.195
Are you all right?

04:40.613 --> 04:42.156
It's nothing.

04:49.664 --> 04:52.375
Are you Kanata's mother?

04:58.298 --> 05:03.303
I was at my part-time job
when I got the call.

05:03.803 --> 05:05.555
You must have been shocked.

05:06.264 --> 05:07.098
Yes.

05:08.641 --> 05:11.686
I'm sorry, but it seems
there are marks on Kanata's body

05:12.437 --> 05:16.024
that were unrelated to the accident.

05:16.107 --> 05:18.359
Do you have any idea what they might be?

05:21.821 --> 05:22.864
Ms. Togawa?

05:23.948 --> 05:25.241
I don't know.

05:25.325 --> 05:26.576
I'm sorry.

05:27.243 --> 05:29.579
Was Kanata at home alone today?

05:30.163 --> 05:31.664
I think so.

05:31.748 --> 05:33.583
Sorry for asking,

05:33.666 --> 05:36.627
but you were divorced
five years ago, right?

05:37.670 --> 05:39.922
Are you living alone with Kanata now?

05:41.090 --> 05:42.467
For the most part, yes.

05:42.550 --> 05:43.426
For the most part?

05:44.093 --> 05:47.764
The person I'm dating
also comes over sometimes.

05:50.516 --> 05:52.769
Where is that person now?

05:53.352 --> 05:55.396
I can't get in touch with him right now.

05:55.480 --> 05:57.523
I think he'll be back soon, though.

05:58.107 --> 06:00.693
Could you tell me more about him?

06:02.737 --> 06:03.821
Yes.

06:04.655 --> 06:08.034
Kanata fell down the stairs
for some reason.

06:08.117 --> 06:10.870
He hit his head
on the landing midway down the stairs,

06:10.953 --> 06:14.165
resulting in a cerebral contusion
and an acute subdural hematoma.

06:14.248 --> 06:15.500
There are also…

06:16.876 --> 06:19.879
several other bruises
likely caused by hitting the stairs.

06:21.005 --> 06:24.175
Those are the injuries from the fall.

06:25.176 --> 06:27.553
So the rest are from abuse.

06:28.471 --> 06:29.847
That's awful.

06:29.931 --> 06:31.974
Are these all abuse marks?

06:33.184 --> 06:34.602
I think so.

06:34.685 --> 06:36.646
The bruise marks can be covered up

06:36.729 --> 06:39.398
and are a characteristic of child abuse.

06:39.482 --> 06:42.777
There are many scar patches
and keloids on his back, too.

06:43.736 --> 06:45.113
Those are old wounds.

06:46.114 --> 06:48.533
These wounds on his arm
look fairly new, though.

06:49.200 --> 06:52.495
Coexisting old and new wounds
is also a characteristic of abuse.

06:53.371 --> 06:54.413
Doctor.

06:54.914 --> 06:56.791
This might be irrelevant,

06:56.874 --> 06:59.210
but when Kanata was being transported,

06:59.293 --> 07:01.337
he said, "The black monster is coming."

07:01.420 --> 07:02.922
He seemed afraid.

07:03.005 --> 07:05.007
The black monster?

07:05.091 --> 07:09.595
Maybe the person who abused him
looked that terrifying to him.

07:10.513 --> 07:11.639
But isn't it strange?

07:11.722 --> 07:14.142
If he was beaten by someone
who was abusing him,

07:14.225 --> 07:16.727
he would likely say
"I was beaten by the monster."

07:16.811 --> 07:18.855
Instead he said, "The monster is coming."

07:19.439 --> 07:20.731
-True.
-No.

07:20.815 --> 07:22.692
He hit his head and was confused.

07:22.775 --> 07:24.652
Well, sure, but…

07:24.735 --> 07:25.611
Anyway,

07:25.695 --> 07:28.948
let's first investigate
what Kanata's daily life was like.

07:29.907 --> 07:30.867
-Okay.
-Okay.

07:46.549 --> 07:47.550
Come in.

07:51.137 --> 07:52.346
Excuse me.

07:59.687 --> 08:01.063
Long time no see.

08:01.564 --> 08:02.815
Professor Kujo.

08:05.485 --> 08:08.112
Has it been 15 years already?

08:09.572 --> 08:11.991
A lot of time has passed, hasn't it?

08:13.784 --> 08:15.077
I heard…

08:15.161 --> 08:17.163
I heard you're now working

08:17.663 --> 08:20.917
at a death investigation facility
established by the Ministry.

08:21.000 --> 08:21.876
Yes.

08:23.377 --> 08:26.297
Professor, how is your health?

08:29.050 --> 08:31.385
The cancer has spread all over.

08:31.469 --> 08:33.930
They say I have three months left.

08:37.308 --> 08:39.477
I've lived long enough.

08:40.520 --> 08:41.854
I'll let myself…

08:43.523 --> 08:46.108
relax here for a little while longer.

08:49.111 --> 08:51.447
You mean Ms. Togawa from 401, right?

08:51.531 --> 08:53.616
I've heard screaming and things before.

08:53.699 --> 08:55.201
What kind of screaming?

08:55.284 --> 08:58.162
In the middle of the night,
suddenly, like "wahh!"

08:58.663 --> 09:01.249
I couldn't tell
what they were saying, though.

09:01.332 --> 09:03.459
It didn't use to be like that, though.

09:03.960 --> 09:06.712
The mom started dating
a scary-looking guy.

09:06.796 --> 09:07.964
That's when it started.

09:08.506 --> 09:12.051
I saw Kanata
crying a lot in the park once.

09:12.134 --> 09:14.470
How did Kanata look to you?

09:14.554 --> 09:15.555
He was terrified.

09:16.055 --> 09:17.890
He was screaming.

09:17.974 --> 09:19.767
I felt so bad for him.

09:22.562 --> 09:24.272
I heard from the detective.

09:24.772 --> 09:25.982
I was shocked.

09:26.065 --> 09:28.859
To think that Kanata
would have an accident like that.

09:31.153 --> 09:34.365
Mr. Kamijo, since the divorce,
have you seen Kanata?

09:35.324 --> 09:37.743
I haven't seen him for years.

09:39.328 --> 09:40.746
We divorced

09:41.747 --> 09:44.250
because of my affair.

09:44.333 --> 09:46.085
I didn't feel like I could face him.

09:47.295 --> 09:48.129
Sir…

09:48.838 --> 09:52.091
There's also a suspicion
that Kanata was being abused.

09:52.174 --> 09:53.968
Do you know anything about that?

09:55.595 --> 09:56.846
I've heard rumors.

09:57.638 --> 09:58.639
I was worried.

09:59.223 --> 10:00.099
Rumors?

10:00.182 --> 10:03.060
Saya started dating a bad guy.

10:05.146 --> 10:07.064
If I had taken Kanata in,

10:07.773 --> 10:08.774
this would never…

10:13.362 --> 10:14.822
I should go see him.

10:15.948 --> 10:17.700
I could buy him some kintsuba.

10:19.994 --> 10:23.748
Even though he's a kid,
he loves Japanese sweets.

10:25.249 --> 10:27.209
I'm sure that would make him happy.

10:27.293 --> 10:30.463
But maybe his tastes have changed by now.

10:32.173 --> 10:33.591
I bet he has grown up.

10:36.677 --> 10:39.472
Ryoji Kida, 34 years old.
A construction worker.

10:39.555 --> 10:41.641
He's Saya Togawa's boyfriend.

10:41.724 --> 10:44.644
We haven't been able
to contact Kida since the incident,

10:44.727 --> 10:47.772
and it seems he didn't show up
for work today either.

10:48.522 --> 10:51.776
So the mother's boyfriend is the abuser.

10:51.859 --> 10:52.902
I think so.

10:53.653 --> 10:54.654
However…

10:55.279 --> 10:56.113
What?

10:56.197 --> 10:58.407
Regarding the knife that was found,

10:58.491 --> 11:01.952
it seems only Kanata's fingerprints
were detected on it.

11:02.036 --> 11:04.163
Kanata's? Not Kida's?

11:04.246 --> 11:05.122
Yes.

11:05.206 --> 11:06.582
And one more thing.

11:06.666 --> 11:07.500
What?

11:07.583 --> 11:09.960
Well, it might not be relevant, actually.

11:10.044 --> 11:11.253
Just say it.

11:11.337 --> 11:12.171
Yes, ma'am.

11:13.506 --> 11:15.716
Well, about Kida…

11:16.675 --> 11:19.637
It seems he was abused himself
in the past.

11:19.720 --> 11:20.721
RYOJI KIDA

11:20.805 --> 11:22.014
He was?

11:22.098 --> 11:24.308
Ms. Kiryu said she heard it
from the police.

11:24.392 --> 11:28.437
Apparently, he was quite severely abused
by his stepfather when he was a child.

11:28.521 --> 11:31.899
Even though he was abused himself,
he abuses a child?

11:31.982 --> 11:34.318
Well, don't they say
people who were abused

11:34.402 --> 11:37.988
tend to become abusers themselves
when they grow up?

11:38.072 --> 11:40.991
Maybe because that's
the kind of parent they saw?

11:41.075 --> 11:43.536
A cycle of abuse, so to speak.

11:43.619 --> 11:46.080
Taking the pain you suffered
out on a child…

11:46.163 --> 11:47.998
Right…

12:05.182 --> 12:08.060
I'm glad you took the time to come.

12:10.729 --> 12:15.401
I was only able to get where I am
because of you, Professor.

12:17.319 --> 12:18.446
"Loved One."

12:21.240 --> 12:24.368
How to face a body.

12:26.287 --> 12:27.538
To doubt common sense,

12:28.038 --> 12:31.542
not to be bound by precedent,
and to have free thought.

12:33.419 --> 12:38.632
I was captivated by this field of study
because of your words.

12:39.925 --> 12:41.886
You remember them well.

12:42.470 --> 12:43.512
But…

12:45.139 --> 12:46.974
during that case,

12:48.100 --> 12:50.102
you didn't do any of that, Professor.

13:00.613 --> 13:04.575
The Shiramine serial femicide case.

13:07.369 --> 13:09.038
You remember it, don't you?

13:11.415 --> 13:16.128
I intend to face that case once more.

13:17.880 --> 13:19.298
Fifteen years ago…

13:19.381 --> 13:20.925
SHIRAMINE SERIAL FEMICIDE CASE
RESEARCH DATA

13:21.008 --> 13:24.261
…I ran away from that case.

13:24.762 --> 13:26.597
Even though I had doubts

13:27.389 --> 13:28.933
about your autopsy results.

13:31.101 --> 13:32.603
At that time,

13:32.686 --> 13:36.774
I didn't have the power or the knowledge
to overturn it.

13:37.691 --> 13:38.776
But now,

13:39.360 --> 13:42.530
I might be able
to unravel the contradictions.

13:44.907 --> 13:46.784
Please tell me, Professor.

13:48.077 --> 13:51.664
What really happened
behind the scenes of that case?

14:02.925 --> 14:04.843
Well, isn't this a rare visitor?

14:06.428 --> 14:07.429
Kyoko.

14:08.305 --> 14:10.307
Don't push my father too hard.

14:14.520 --> 14:17.189
I'm sorry for coming
at such a difficult time.

14:25.239 --> 14:26.365
I'll come again.

14:27.449 --> 14:28.284
Okay.

14:44.049 --> 14:45.426
You're back.

14:47.553 --> 14:49.179
How long will you be in Japan?

14:49.763 --> 14:51.348
For a while.

14:54.476 --> 14:56.270
You haven't changed at all.

14:56.770 --> 14:58.355
That's not true.

15:04.194 --> 15:06.614
You've heard about my father, right?

15:08.032 --> 15:09.325
He has little time left.

15:12.161 --> 15:13.329
I want him

15:14.371 --> 15:17.207
to be able to forget everything
and pass away in peace.

15:21.545 --> 15:24.089
The serial murders happening recently…

15:27.217 --> 15:29.595
They're similar
to the Shiramine murder case.

15:29.678 --> 15:31.347
There might be a connection.

15:35.809 --> 15:38.103
Even if there is a connection,

15:38.812 --> 15:40.898
it has nothing to do
with you or my father.

15:42.232 --> 15:43.609
Don't come back.

15:44.985 --> 15:46.445
You should forget it too.

16:04.129 --> 16:09.134
This is the fifth case this year
of a girl being found strangled to death.

16:10.719 --> 16:12.930
They're similar
to the Shiramine murder case.

16:13.013 --> 16:14.723
You should forget it too.

16:21.480 --> 16:23.649
Kanata has apparently
been terrified at school

16:23.732 --> 16:26.151
for about a year,
saying he didn't want to go home.

16:27.444 --> 16:30.781
That matches the time
Ms. Togawa started dating Kida.

16:31.365 --> 16:32.741
It does.

16:33.534 --> 16:34.410
Detective Dojima.

16:34.493 --> 16:35.494
What?

16:35.577 --> 16:37.204
Kida has turned himself in.

16:40.916 --> 16:42.710
Like I said,

16:42.793 --> 16:44.795
Kanata was being annoying.

16:44.878 --> 16:47.214
He never listened to me,

16:47.297 --> 16:49.967
so sometimes I slapped him,
telling him to be quiet.

16:50.968 --> 16:52.553
It was the same that day.

16:52.636 --> 16:55.055
He wouldn't stop crying,
and was bothering others.

16:55.639 --> 16:56.890
So,

16:56.974 --> 16:58.475
I gave him a light push.

17:03.522 --> 17:05.149
I'm sorry for running away.

17:05.232 --> 17:06.692
But I just panicked.

17:06.775 --> 17:08.902
What about the knife we found
at the scene?

17:08.986 --> 17:10.112
No idea.

17:11.321 --> 17:13.407
It's not related to the incident?

17:14.491 --> 17:16.744
Calling it an incident or abuse…

17:16.827 --> 17:19.455
All I did was discipline him a little.

17:20.080 --> 17:21.665
Discipline, you say?

17:21.749 --> 17:22.791
That's right.

17:22.875 --> 17:26.295
That was just a little discipline.

17:26.378 --> 17:28.255
This is just some discipline.

17:28.338 --> 17:29.757
I'm sorry!

17:29.840 --> 17:30.841
Don't cry!

17:30.924 --> 17:32.259
I'm sorry!

17:33.385 --> 17:35.095
I'm sorry!

17:36.972 --> 17:38.098
Dr. Takamori?

17:39.600 --> 17:41.977
Are you okay? Dr. Takamori?

17:43.020 --> 17:44.438
Hey, are you okay?

17:44.521 --> 17:45.898
How is Kida?

17:45.981 --> 17:48.484
He's in the holding cell now
and is being quiet.

17:48.567 --> 17:50.778
He said he doesn't need
a lawyer or any visitors.

17:50.861 --> 17:51.945
That's great, right?

17:52.029 --> 17:53.405
The case was solved easily.

17:53.489 --> 17:55.365
I don't think it's solved.

17:55.866 --> 17:56.950
What?

18:07.211 --> 18:08.629
Are you okay?

18:17.012 --> 18:18.555
I'm sorry.

18:18.639 --> 18:19.848
No, not at all.

18:23.727 --> 18:27.397
Go home for the day and get some rest.

18:28.190 --> 18:30.484
We need you to get well soon.

18:31.193 --> 18:32.569
Since you'll be a dad.

18:41.203 --> 18:42.704
I don't have the confidence.

18:48.210 --> 18:49.753
I was abused, too.

18:51.296 --> 18:52.506
A long time ago.

18:56.677 --> 18:58.428
By my stepfather.

19:01.682 --> 19:04.226
When he got drunk, he would get violent.

19:06.937 --> 19:09.356
I still have the scars.

19:10.858 --> 19:12.734
They're on my back.

19:14.611 --> 19:16.697
They're very similar to Kanata's scars.

19:18.740 --> 19:22.995
I'm sorry for making you remember
something so unpleasant.

19:27.207 --> 19:28.709
I didn't remember it.

19:30.669 --> 19:32.629
It's always in my head.

19:34.006 --> 19:35.257
Kida…

19:38.218 --> 19:41.180
was also abused by his parents.

19:44.641 --> 19:46.143
And now,

19:46.768 --> 19:48.937
he's the one abusing a child.

19:53.442 --> 19:54.818
I'm scared…

19:58.614 --> 20:00.032
that one day…

20:03.493 --> 20:06.914
I might also end up raising
my hand against my own child.

20:06.997 --> 20:09.458
No, you would never.

20:18.550 --> 20:19.760
But maybe…

20:22.471 --> 20:24.848
because you experienced that,

20:26.725 --> 20:28.894
there is something you can do.

20:32.064 --> 20:34.024
I think you're the one who understands

20:35.484 --> 20:38.153
how much Kanata suffers

20:39.738 --> 20:41.907
better than anyone, Dr. Takamori.

21:00.259 --> 21:01.635
I'm sorry…

21:04.054 --> 21:05.430
Kanata.

21:25.993 --> 21:29.871
MY CHECKUP IS DONE
THEY SAID THE BABY IS VERY HEALTHY!

21:55.188 --> 21:56.606
This is Masumi.

21:57.816 --> 22:01.236
This is Takamori.
Sorry for calling while you're on leave.

22:01.320 --> 22:03.530
No, it's fine.

22:04.239 --> 22:05.615
Did something happen?

22:10.454 --> 22:14.458
I'm sorry for leaving
the investigation entirely to you.

22:14.958 --> 22:17.544
I've heard about the situation
from Ms. Kiryu.

22:19.338 --> 22:22.215
I don't know what to do.

22:25.260 --> 22:27.304
The suspect turned himself in,

22:28.513 --> 22:30.807
but I feel like nothing
has been solved yet.

22:34.227 --> 22:37.773
I was wondering what you would do
in a situation like this.

22:40.233 --> 22:41.735
If it were me,

22:42.360 --> 22:44.821
I would re-examine
the remaining contradictions.

22:45.322 --> 22:46.948
Like, the wounds on the arm.

22:47.032 --> 22:51.036
Those wounds were arranged in parallel
with a certain regularity.

22:52.079 --> 22:56.583
In cases of abuse, scars and bruises
would be scattered randomly,

22:56.666 --> 22:59.544
not perfectly parallel.

22:59.628 --> 23:00.921
It doesn't add up.

23:03.965 --> 23:08.345
But, please keep in mind,
this is just how I would do it.

23:09.679 --> 23:14.518
How one faces forensic medicine
is free and different for everyone.

23:15.727 --> 23:16.978
Dr. Takamori,

23:17.687 --> 23:20.690
how will you solve this mystery?

23:29.574 --> 23:32.035
Dr. Takamori is late, isn't he?

23:32.119 --> 23:33.829
There's no point in waiting.

23:33.912 --> 23:35.664
Let's start with what we can do.

23:35.747 --> 23:37.833
Sorry, I'm late.

23:37.916 --> 23:39.417
Dr. Takamori.

23:39.501 --> 23:43.672
I've decided
to try and find the truth one more time.

23:45.715 --> 23:49.636
I've reclassified Kanata's scars
based on their characteristics.

23:51.012 --> 23:52.889
Contusions on the head from the fall.

23:52.973 --> 23:55.809
Bruises and burn marks,
which suggest abuse.

23:55.892 --> 23:58.478
And systematic wounds on the left arm.

23:58.562 --> 23:59.855
Looking at them like this,

23:59.938 --> 24:03.066
they each seem to be wounds
inflicted in different ways.

24:03.150 --> 24:04.151
Right.

24:04.234 --> 24:05.527
That's easy to understand.

24:06.027 --> 24:09.197
So the arm wounds are the only ones
that are strange after all.

24:12.450 --> 24:16.997
I want everyone to analyze
these arm wounds in detail.

24:17.080 --> 24:17.914
Okay.

24:17.998 --> 24:18.832
Understood.

24:19.958 --> 24:20.959
What about you?

24:21.835 --> 24:23.044
I…

24:28.341 --> 24:29.759
A long time ago,

24:30.594 --> 24:32.679
I was abused by my stepfather.

24:38.310 --> 24:40.562
I looked back at my own experience.

24:41.897 --> 24:44.858
Abuse always happens inside the house.

24:45.442 --> 24:47.611
I'm going to look for clues there.

24:51.531 --> 24:54.618
I'm sorry for having you come
all the way out here with us.

24:54.701 --> 24:57.370
It can't be helped,
since the police need to be present.

24:57.454 --> 24:58.788
It's a big help.

25:00.540 --> 25:02.626
I want clues too.

25:09.424 --> 25:12.052
I'm sorry for taking up your time.

25:12.135 --> 25:16.264
Since it is such a serious case, we need
to investigate inside the home as well.

25:16.348 --> 25:20.060
I don't want to leave Kanata alone
for a long time…

25:20.560 --> 25:22.270
We won't stay long.

25:28.360 --> 25:29.444
Is something wrong?

25:30.779 --> 25:32.113
It's not roughed up.

25:34.324 --> 25:35.158
What?

25:37.744 --> 25:39.079
When there's abuse,

25:40.205 --> 25:42.916
there are marks
on the walls and everywhere.

25:42.999 --> 25:46.503
From going on a rampage
and throwing things and stuff.

25:48.546 --> 25:49.839
That's how it was at my place.

25:54.511 --> 25:55.470
Here you go.

25:55.553 --> 25:57.138
Please, don't trouble yourself.

25:58.556 --> 25:59.849
Thank you very much.

25:59.933 --> 26:01.351
Have some of this too.

26:02.769 --> 26:05.063
He likes them, so I bought some.

26:12.195 --> 26:13.738
Those are nice photos.

26:18.660 --> 26:20.745
That was Kida's influence too.

26:21.579 --> 26:25.292
He does martial arts,
so he said he watches his calories

26:25.375 --> 26:28.211
and chooses Japanese
sweets over Western ones,

26:28.878 --> 26:30.922
so Kanata started eating them to copy him.

26:31.589 --> 26:33.800
Forgive me for asking, Saya,

26:33.883 --> 26:38.221
but did you not notice that Kida
was committing abuse?

26:40.682 --> 26:41.850
Or perhaps,

26:42.517 --> 26:45.061
did you not think he was committing abuse?

26:46.771 --> 26:48.857
I don't know.

26:50.775 --> 26:51.735
Well then,

26:51.818 --> 26:53.862
what about the "monster"?

26:54.904 --> 26:59.075
The "black monster" Kanata mentioned
when he was being transported.

26:59.659 --> 27:01.286
Do you have any ideas?

27:07.500 --> 27:09.210
I only vaguely remember…

27:11.171 --> 27:13.798
I might have read him
a picture book about that.

27:14.382 --> 27:15.633
A picture book?

27:16.676 --> 27:17.969
THE BLACK MONSTER

27:18.053 --> 27:22.807
The Black Monster,
a picture book published in the '80s.

27:24.225 --> 27:25.560
One night,

27:25.643 --> 27:29.814
a black monster appears before a child
who does nothing but play pranks.

27:29.898 --> 27:32.442
Eerie hands stretch out from the darkness

27:32.525 --> 27:34.736
and wrap around the child.

27:35.445 --> 27:37.989
He desperately resisted,
and drove it away.

27:38.073 --> 27:40.950
But after that,
every time he did something bad,

27:41.034 --> 27:44.037
the black hands
would wrap around the child again.

27:45.455 --> 27:46.498
In the end,

27:46.581 --> 27:49.918
the black hands wrapped around
the child's arms and wouldn't let go,

27:50.001 --> 27:53.505
and he finally ended up
becoming a black monster himself.

27:53.588 --> 27:54.881
The end.

27:55.382 --> 27:57.592
Why is it such a hopeless story?

27:58.968 --> 28:01.679
A lesson not to do bad things?

28:02.514 --> 28:07.268
If the thing Kanata feared
was the monster from this picture book…

28:21.241 --> 28:22.325
Kanata?

28:24.035 --> 28:24.953
Kanata!

28:27.664 --> 28:28.873
Kanata…

28:34.587 --> 28:35.797
Kanata,

28:36.631 --> 28:39.342
can you talk to us for just a little bit?

28:41.261 --> 28:42.137
Yes.

28:42.220 --> 28:43.054
Thank you.

28:44.723 --> 28:47.851
Do you remember what happened
when you fell down the stairs?

28:55.900 --> 28:57.068
I don't know.

28:57.861 --> 29:00.155
I don't really remember.

29:01.197 --> 29:02.323
I see.

29:04.200 --> 29:07.620
It looks like you have quite
a few injuries besides your head.

29:09.372 --> 29:10.999
Where did you get hurt?

29:16.588 --> 29:20.425
Can I look at your wounds
for just a second?

29:21.176 --> 29:22.343
Yes.

29:26.514 --> 29:27.432
Sorry.

29:34.689 --> 29:35.607
Kanata!

29:35.690 --> 29:37.859
I'm scared, I'm scared!

29:37.942 --> 29:39.402
The monster is coming!

29:39.486 --> 29:41.488
The black monster!

29:43.114 --> 29:44.199
Kanata!

29:47.076 --> 29:48.912
I'm sorry, that's enough for today.

29:49.913 --> 29:51.164
Kanata.

29:51.247 --> 29:52.207
You'll be okay.

29:53.208 --> 29:55.084
Doctor, what's that?

29:55.168 --> 29:57.587
This is Kanata's head MRI.

29:57.670 --> 30:00.548
-Something is bugging me.
-Bugging you?

30:01.549 --> 30:02.717
This.

30:03.635 --> 30:04.636
What is it?

30:08.431 --> 30:12.268
Those wounds were arranged in parallel
with a certain regularity.

30:13.102 --> 30:14.312
In the end,

30:14.395 --> 30:17.148
the black hands wrapped around
the child's arms and wouldn't let go,

30:17.232 --> 30:19.776
and he finally ended up
becoming a black monster himself.

30:19.859 --> 30:21.319
The black monster!

30:23.738 --> 30:25.198
Dr. Takamori?

30:25.782 --> 30:26.825
Now…

30:27.617 --> 30:29.536
the pieces might be coming together.

30:33.081 --> 30:35.458
What else do you want?
I already told you everything.

30:35.542 --> 30:36.835
No, you haven't.

30:36.918 --> 30:38.962
I need you to tell me the truth.

30:39.587 --> 30:40.505
What?

30:40.588 --> 30:45.426
You weren't the one abusing Kanata.

30:52.976 --> 30:55.103
How is Kanata doing?

30:56.396 --> 30:59.065
Are you not going to see him, Mr. Kamijo?

31:00.400 --> 31:02.235
Well, even if I did…

31:03.152 --> 31:04.487
It was you, wasn't it?

31:05.530 --> 31:07.574
You were the one abusing Kanata.

31:09.617 --> 31:11.160
What kind of nonsense is that?

31:11.244 --> 31:13.580
Looking at Kanata's head MRI,

31:13.663 --> 31:16.749
there is slight atrophy
in the temporal and frontal lobes.

31:17.333 --> 31:18.209
Atrophy?

31:18.293 --> 31:22.380
This is a characteristic seen in children
who have been abused in the past.

31:22.463 --> 31:25.174
It is said that
the emotional scars received

31:25.258 --> 31:27.427
manifest in the brain.

31:29.178 --> 31:31.389
Kanata's scars are also unnatural.

31:31.472 --> 31:33.349
The wounds on his back and thighs

31:33.433 --> 31:36.227
have a different color tone
compared to the others.

31:36.311 --> 31:37.228
Those wounds

31:37.812 --> 31:41.649
might date back much further
than a year ago,

31:42.150 --> 31:45.528
to before you even started dating Saya.

31:46.529 --> 31:47.822
In other words,

31:48.323 --> 31:50.909
he was being abused

31:51.618 --> 31:55.079
long before she met you.

31:55.163 --> 31:56.414
Mr. Kamijo,

31:57.332 --> 31:59.667
these are considered
wounds from past abuse

32:00.585 --> 32:02.837
that occurred when he was living with you.

32:04.297 --> 32:06.257
Stop joking around.

32:06.341 --> 32:07.300
Why would I--

32:07.383 --> 32:09.135
You said it the other day, didn't you?

32:09.218 --> 32:11.304
That Kanata likes kintsuba.

32:11.387 --> 32:12.805
Of course I know what my son--

32:12.889 --> 32:17.268
Kanata only started liking kintsuba
after meeting Mr. Kida.

32:17.352 --> 32:19.395
That happened within the past year.

32:20.939 --> 32:24.233
You said you haven't seen him in years,
so how did you know?

32:26.152 --> 32:30.615
You've actually been seeing Kanata
over the past year, haven't you?

32:31.407 --> 32:32.659
The question is,

32:32.742 --> 32:36.663
why are you protecting Kamijo,
when you have nothing to do with him?

32:39.123 --> 32:40.583
I don't know.

32:41.250 --> 32:42.877
I'm not protecting anybody.

32:42.961 --> 32:48.257
The important clue for us
was the parallel wounds

32:48.341 --> 32:50.718
carved into Kanata's left arm.

32:50.802 --> 32:52.845
Normally, if someone
continued to abuse a person,

32:52.929 --> 32:55.348
the wounds would be more random.

32:56.599 --> 32:57.934
But those wounds

32:58.434 --> 33:01.729
were placed systematically,
in the same spot

33:01.813 --> 33:03.940
over and over again in the same way.

33:05.274 --> 33:07.986
They aren't scars
from abuse by another person.

33:09.404 --> 33:13.783
They're scars that Kanata
was inflicting on himself.

33:14.409 --> 33:16.577
to stop the black monster from coming.

33:16.661 --> 33:19.831
The black monster is coming… The monster…

33:22.041 --> 33:23.793
Three months ago,

33:23.876 --> 33:26.170
during a drinking session
with old friends,

33:26.254 --> 33:29.507
you apparently heard
that Saya had a new lover.

33:30.425 --> 33:33.761
You seemed to have become very jealous.

33:35.972 --> 33:37.807
-Coming!
-So then…

33:38.391 --> 33:40.309
You went to Saya's home.

33:43.021 --> 33:44.272
Please leave.

33:44.355 --> 33:46.524
What's the big deal? I'm your ex-husband.

34:00.705 --> 34:02.206
Are you her new boyfriend?

34:03.249 --> 34:04.500
Please leave.

34:09.172 --> 34:10.757
You've grown, Kanata.

34:13.176 --> 34:14.093
Hey.

34:14.802 --> 34:17.638
Daddy's talking to you.
You should answer.

34:18.222 --> 34:22.185
Past memories of being beaten
flashed back to Kanata.

34:23.061 --> 34:27.857
To resist the trauma,
so that the black monster wouldn't come,

34:27.940 --> 34:29.692
Kanata, it's okay.

34:29.776 --> 34:31.778
-The monster…
-Go away, now!

34:32.361 --> 34:34.030
I'm scared! Stop!

34:34.113 --> 34:35.198
Kanata!

34:35.281 --> 34:36.491
What is this?

34:36.574 --> 34:38.242
No, the monster!

34:38.326 --> 34:40.161
-Hey, Kanata!
-The monster…

34:42.747 --> 34:44.040
It's okay now.

34:44.123 --> 34:45.083
You're okay.

34:48.628 --> 34:49.504
All right!

34:50.254 --> 34:52.465
You're doing it. Go!

34:58.721 --> 35:00.348
I'm scared!

35:00.431 --> 35:02.183
-No!
-It's okay.

35:02.266 --> 35:04.352
-Should we do something?
-No! Stop!

35:04.435 --> 35:07.647
-You're okay!
-Kanata's flashbacks kept coming back.

35:08.648 --> 35:13.611
You wanted to help him somehow,
didn't you?

35:13.694 --> 35:15.154
If you're a man,

35:15.238 --> 35:18.324
you've got to become
strong enough to help your mom.

35:19.700 --> 35:21.202
-But…
-You can do it.

35:23.079 --> 35:24.247
Kanata,

35:25.206 --> 35:26.707
you're strong.

35:28.668 --> 35:31.504
I'm… strong?

35:31.587 --> 35:32.630
Yes.

35:37.677 --> 35:41.597
Thanks to Mr. Kida,
Kanata gradually began to recover.

35:42.682 --> 35:44.642
But then the incident happened…

35:46.519 --> 35:49.272
because you came to Kanata's house again.

35:50.982 --> 35:52.066
Probably,

35:52.150 --> 35:54.443
what happened on that day was…

35:55.194 --> 35:57.155
TOGAWA

36:01.993 --> 36:02.827
What?

36:03.536 --> 36:04.954
Saya's not here?

36:05.037 --> 36:06.164
Where's Saya?

36:06.747 --> 36:07.748
Where did she go?

36:18.426 --> 36:19.635
I am…

36:21.429 --> 36:22.513
strong.

36:23.181 --> 36:24.265
But…

36:24.891 --> 36:26.267
Kida's teachings…

36:27.351 --> 36:29.020
backfired.

36:52.501 --> 36:54.086
Don't talk nonsense.

36:54.587 --> 36:55.838
It wasn't me.

36:56.672 --> 36:58.382
Saya's boyfriend has confessed.

36:59.467 --> 37:00.384
Yes.

37:03.512 --> 37:05.348
After being threatened by you.

37:08.726 --> 37:10.436
From my perspective,

37:10.519 --> 37:14.273
I just went to the house
and was almost stabbed to death.

37:15.066 --> 37:17.818
This is a clear case of attempted murder.

37:19.362 --> 37:20.988
You've got to be kidding me.

37:21.072 --> 37:22.657
What about you abusing him?

37:22.740 --> 37:25.326
You can't prove something
from that long ago.

37:26.869 --> 37:28.162
On the other hand,

37:28.871 --> 37:31.123
Kanata has strange delusions
and self-harms,

37:31.207 --> 37:33.626
and tries to stab people to death.

37:36.587 --> 37:38.047
He'll go to a detention center.

37:42.885 --> 37:45.012
Just say that you did it.

37:46.430 --> 37:48.099
If you want to save Kanata,

37:51.394 --> 37:52.728
you know what to do.

37:57.942 --> 37:59.068
Mr. Kida…

38:01.821 --> 38:02.989
You had no choice--

38:03.072 --> 38:04.115
I did it.

38:06.617 --> 38:08.035
That's enough, isn't it?

38:12.081 --> 38:13.374
Actually,

38:14.375 --> 38:15.960
before I came here…

38:17.920 --> 38:19.964
Saya told me everything.

38:25.261 --> 38:27.430
I HAVE TO SAY I DID IT, FOR KANATA'S SAKE

38:27.513 --> 38:29.098
After the incident,

38:29.724 --> 38:32.977
she was told
to match what you were going to say,

38:33.561 --> 38:36.063
and she has been hesitant about it
the entire time.

38:37.148 --> 38:39.567
No matter what the police ask you,

38:40.276 --> 38:41.902
just say you don't know.

38:43.195 --> 38:44.697
What about Ryoji?

38:45.865 --> 38:47.199
Where is he?

38:48.200 --> 38:49.535
He's okay.

38:50.786 --> 38:51.871
It'll be fine.

38:52.955 --> 38:54.040
She wondered

38:54.999 --> 38:57.168
if this was really for the best.

38:58.794 --> 39:00.671
There's no way this is a solution.

39:02.798 --> 39:05.760
After all, Kanata likes Ryoji, too.

39:11.474 --> 39:13.225
He really loves him.

39:16.896 --> 39:18.731
That's what Saya said.

39:24.820 --> 39:26.697
The one you were trying to protect

39:27.698 --> 39:29.450
and keep safe

39:31.202 --> 39:32.953
was Kanata, wasn't it?

39:48.844 --> 39:49.804
Yes?

39:51.722 --> 39:56.310
Do you understand how heartbreaking it is
to be beaten by your own parent?

39:58.604 --> 40:01.690
Scars from being beaten by
someone you want to be loved by most

40:03.359 --> 40:05.236
stay with you for a lifetime.

40:11.450 --> 40:12.785
How…

40:13.577 --> 40:16.747
can you do something
so cruel to your own child?

40:19.166 --> 40:23.587
Protecting your precious child
is what a father does, isn't it?

40:30.302 --> 40:31.303
I will never…

40:35.474 --> 40:39.770
become a parent like you.

41:00.749 --> 41:03.461
Mr. Kida has apparently
retracted his confession.

41:05.087 --> 41:06.297
Mr. Kamijo.

41:07.214 --> 41:09.300
Could you come talk with us
at the station?

41:22.229 --> 41:23.772
Feels nice outside, right?

41:23.856 --> 41:24.815
Yeah.

41:32.281 --> 41:33.532
Hey!

41:33.616 --> 41:34.575
It's Ryoji!

41:36.577 --> 41:37.703
Kanata.

41:43.459 --> 41:45.336
I'm not going anywhere anymore.

41:47.713 --> 41:49.423
From now on, we'll always be together.

41:55.679 --> 41:56.722
I…

41:58.474 --> 42:00.726
will make you and your mom happy.

42:03.938 --> 42:05.147
Got it?

42:06.232 --> 42:07.233
Yeah!

42:22.331 --> 42:23.874
Isn't this great?

42:27.086 --> 42:29.213
The cycle of abuse can be broken.

42:31.507 --> 42:32.758
I will break it.

42:33.259 --> 42:34.510
I will.

42:46.522 --> 42:47.690
Good morning.

42:58.284 --> 43:00.494
Oh, Dr. Masumi.

43:00.578 --> 43:01.912
Good morning.

43:01.996 --> 43:03.372
Sorry for waking you.

43:03.455 --> 43:04.665
It's fine.

43:04.748 --> 43:06.792
It's already this late?

43:09.420 --> 43:10.462
Doctor…

43:13.507 --> 43:14.842
Thank you very much.

43:18.679 --> 43:22.099
I am very glad I relied on you,
Dr. Takamori.

43:25.519 --> 43:26.687
Good morning.

43:26.770 --> 43:27.980
Oh! Dr. Masumi!

43:28.063 --> 43:29.273
Good morning.

43:29.356 --> 43:32.443
It was tough without you here.

43:32.526 --> 43:34.320
For Dr. Takamori, it was.

43:34.403 --> 43:35.529
Sure, but…

43:36.196 --> 43:38.282
We should get him
to treat you to something.

43:38.866 --> 43:39.825
No, that's all right.

43:49.460 --> 43:50.461
What?

43:50.544 --> 43:52.504
Oh, dear…

43:52.588 --> 43:53.589
Is something wrong?

43:53.672 --> 43:54.840
Well…

43:54.923 --> 43:57.009
-My wife is in labor.
-What?

43:57.092 --> 43:58.886
-She's about to give birth.
-What?

43:58.969 --> 44:00.304
-What should I do?
-Just go!

44:00.387 --> 44:02.097
Don't worry about things here.

44:02.181 --> 44:03.057
I'm going then!

44:03.140 --> 44:04.099
-Take care!
-Sorry.

44:04.183 --> 44:05.934
-Hey, hey, hey!
-Oh, my bag.

44:07.019 --> 44:08.479
-Be careful!
-Thank you.

44:08.562 --> 44:09.938
-See you!
-Bye!

44:10.022 --> 44:11.273
Bye!

44:23.577 --> 44:25.871
Subtitle translation by: Maslin F.
